    "summary": "A cloth for domestic use; embroidered and with beadwork.  Square in shape; ground made of natural cream tabby linen cloth.  Alternating bands of blue and brown wool embroidery; stylized floral (?) motifs either side of a horizontal line.  Zigzag patterning at one end, worked in salmon pink, lilac and blue.  At all four edges is a band of applied threaded glass (?) beads: white and green diamond patterning.  Suspended at each corner are beaded tassels with small pieces of cloth at each end (two tassels missing).",
